<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLOs end at day's highs,await FOMC result.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLOs end at day's highs,await FOMC result.</headline>
<text>
<p>1630 GMT - OLOs end higher as traders who shorted market before Monday's auction seek paper, and firmer U.S. Treasuries support. Outcome of FOMC awaited, 25 bps rate hike discounted.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.99% (6.04) BE286=, 13 bps over Bunds (14)  MEUR</p>
<p>*OLO fut +0.23 at 120.68 BGBc1 ; Mark/Bfr 20.6320/23 (6315/30)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.40/43 (46/50), 1-wk repo 3.33/38 (44/48)  TTFBXL</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
